<div>
    <p>Greetings, {{steward-name}}!</p>

    <p>{{steward-name}}, you, or someone on your behalf, has indicated that <a href="{{permalink}}">{{post.post_title}}</a> is no longer necessary, and that it should be removed from the website.</p>

    {{#if meta.mark-for-deletion.reason}}
        <p>The requestor has included the following reason for requesting that this content be deleted:</p>

        <div>
            {{meta.mark-for-deletion.reason}}
        </div>
    {{/if}}

    <p><b><i>What happens next?</i></b></p>

    <ul>
        <li>The {{managing-office}} staff member(s) assigned to this content has received a copy of this message.</li>
        <li>That {{managing-office}} staff member will review the content and determine whether it really should be removed.</li>
        <li>If it should be removed, they will delete the page permanently from the website.</li>
        <li>If the content does not appear that it should be removed, they will attempt to identify a new primary steward to manage the item.</li>
    </ul>

    <p><b>This is an automatic email. Please do not reply directly to this email.</b></p>

    <p>Thank you for your work in keeping your pages up-to-date.</p>
</div>